# Demo server

Airwallex and Anthropic are not on the sandbox proxy allowlist. A server
started in the default shell gets `httpx.ProxyError: 403 Forbidden` on login,
and the chat shows a failed request.

Start and restart uvicorn with `required_permissions: ["all"]` so the sandbox
proxy is not injected. Run this from the project root:

```bash
.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```

A terminal the user opens themselves is also fine. Do not start this server
in the default sandbox.
